// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - IminezDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P371863954" "I don't know what the Ministry is trying to pull here, {HeroName}, but my orders are to let you have run of the place."
// Answer Text :
"P3983696504" "What can you tell me about the situation inside?"
// Page IntroPage2 Text :
"P2581501295" "The Resistance have one of the researchers held hostage. If you need help, you call and my boys will be more than happy to lend a hand."
// Answer Text :
"P4083659489" "Thanks, I appreciate the back up."
// Answer Text :
"P3141335946" "I got it handled, officer."
// Answer Text :
"P3436275287" "Why don't you get me some coffee, Iminez?"
// Answer Text :
"P4289148028" "I could really go for some some tea."
// Answer Text :
"P973505277" "Tell your boys to watch it, I'd hate to get their blood on Mr. Houston's shirt."
// Page BackUpPage1 Text :
"P732666937" "Oh, we're <i>more</i> than happy to help if you get into trouble."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page HandledPage1 Text :
"P2987444115" "Like I said, you've got run of the place. Don't come crying to me if you run into more than you can handle."
// Page CoffeePage1 Text :
"P750699099" "You think you're real hot stuff, huh, {HeroName}? I've been working Imperial City for 15 years, pukes like you don't impress me."
// Answer Text :
"P3903522162" "I like my coffee black, thanks."
// Answer Text :
"P1676500421" "That's two creams, no sugar."
// Answer Text :
"P1681792714" "Make sure they put half the bottle of sugar in it. Alright, I'm counting on you."
// Answer Text :
"P4163423959" "Make sure it's decaf. I don't sit in an office all day so I don't need the pick me up."
// Page CoffeeBlackPage1 Text :
"P2484469873" "<color orange>Iminez just glares at you, you've made your point.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2712130849" "Remember, black, none of that fancy shmancy stuff on it. (Leave)"
// Page TwoCreamsPage1 Text :
"P1945966559" "<color orange>Iminez gives you a rude hand gesture and turns his attention to an <i>important</i> message over his head set.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3585895533" "(Hold up two fingers and mouth the words 'two creams' to him and smile.) (Leave)"
// Page SugarPage1 Text :
"P1261128826" "<color orange>Iminez smiles at you.</color> Sure thing, boss."
// Answer Text :
"P3957265346" "I believe in you. (Leave)"
// Page DecafPage1 Text :
"P2106181359" "<color orange>Iminez shakes his head at you.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1024821171" "Get a move on, chief, you're looking a little tired. (Leave)"
// Page TeaPage1 Text :
"P1829610467" "What? Do you think this is a tea party? What am I, your butler?"
// Answer Text :
"P3514338943" "Herbal blend with a touch of honey, it does wonders for the mood. Thanks."
// Answer Text :
"P3650889975" "Oolong, and don't steep it for too long. I hate it when it gets bitter."
// Answer Text :
"P3311463161" "Chamomile. And get me a scone while you're at it."
// Answer Text :
"P3803633070" "Tea, earl grey, hot. Make it so."
// Page HerbalPage1 Text :
"P653765924" "Sure thing, your majesty. <color orange>Iminez mutters curses under his breath.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P4244824146" "See what I'm talking about? (Leave)"
// Page OolongPage1 Text :
"P1997463462" "Steep? I don't even know what you're talking about. Get your own darn tea."
// Answer Text :
"P670344410" "See what I mean about bitter? (Leave)"
// Page ChamomilePage1 Text :
"P1254846173" "Actually... A scone doesn't sound half bad right now."
// Answer Text :
"P132552181" "Get one for Houston while you're at it. (Leave)"
// Page EarlGreyPage1 Text :
"P1521029142" "...<br><br>...<br><br>really?"
// Answer Text :
"P1838546327" "Yes, that just happened. (Leave)"
// Page BloodPage1 Text :
"P4086832698" "<color orange>Sergeant Iminez's face twitches with rage.</color><br><br>All units, {HeroName} is on scene with a TPN reporter in tow. Give {Hero.gender=male him|her} a wide berth. I want zero problems. Over."
// Answer Text :
"P1520475893" "Good call. (Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3909175559" "Let's get down to business, shall we?<br><br>There is a situation unfolding in Industry Avenue at <color yellow>Holon Technologies</color>. The PPD are on scene, but, we have a very strong reason to believe that they may not be <i>reliable</i> in the apprehension of the Resistance elements holed up inside the facility.<br><br><color orange>I'm sending you to Holon Technologies to take control of the situation and make the arrests.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P4009560741" "Arrest Resistance forces in Holon Technologies"
// SendOffString :
"P2003004070" "Oh, another thing. <color yellow>TPN, the Total Praetoria Network</color> is within their rights to accompany you with one of their <color yellow>investigative reporters</color>.<br><br>Don't let it distract you from your job, but, make sure that he catches everything that happens inside.<br><br>I can't give you the details right now, {HeroName}, but I assure you, as long as that camera is rolling, this operation will go smoothly."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4042123323" "Arrest Resistance in Holon Technologies"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2584323310" "The terrorist forces are still inside Holon Technologies and the PPD have yet to move. Not surprising, really, but I'll tell you about that later. Get down there and end the stalemate."
// TaskTitle :
"P1550282725" "<color deepskyblue>The Trash Collectors</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1329090637" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Carpe Diem</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P431683658" "As you approached the building you were met by the enthusiastic and fast talking John Houston, TPN's most self absorbed investigative reporter. Together you pushed past some sour faced PPD officers and entered the building."
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P3534939787" "You exit Holon Technologies with the hostage saved, John Houston gushing about how amazing you are, and Sergeant Iminez and the PPD looking sour faced and tongue tied. MICIR interrogators arrive on scene to bring the terrorists in for questioning."
