// Script Variable HERO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P585538892" "{HeroName}, great to meet you, this is John Houston with TPN.<em>We're gonna make magic today, {Hero.gender=male kid|babe}, magic!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1258957148" "As you can see, {HeroName} takes command of any situation {Hero.gender=male he|she} is thrust into. When {Hero.gender=male he|she} speaks, people listen."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2640514616" "Outstanding! Did you see that!?<em>{HeroName} completely shattered the terrorists holding this scientist hostage, and the man is not even scratched!<em>Phenomenal!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4235634748" "When I got this assignment I have to admit, I was a little worried that something might happen to me. Now... I'm pretty confident that {HeroName} has got the situation handled."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2554959739" "Watch the way {HeroName} moves, the way {Hero.gender=male he|she} uses the superior numbers of  {Hero.gender=male his|her} enemies against them.<em>This is key, folks. A lot of people can talk and theorize about how a fight flows, but it's all theory, it's all just words until the actual moment of combat happens.<em>This is what Powers Division is all about. These people are trained warriors."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3088166500" "Did you guys see that back at the studio?! Did you catch that?<em>{HeroName} just sighed... Like {Hero.gender=male he|she} was bored.<em>Consider that for a moment. The amount of adrenaline pumping through me right now, I... I can barely talk straight, and {HeroName} is barely registering a pulse!<em>This is the caliber of warrior you are dealing with when Powers Division comes knocking.<em>Resistance! Hang up your weapons now and throw down your failed ideology. You can't stand up against this kind of power!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P938612986" "{HeroName} just cleaned out the entire facility. The lab is quiet now. I can hear my heart beat. It's still quite fast. But, I have to be honest with you back at the studio. I never really felt like I was in danger.<em> During this whole battle... Its, its a battlefield really, a warzone. I knew that {HeroName} was in control.<em>That's key. When you lose control, that's when good people get hurt.<em>{HeroName} was, to put it in a single word, 'Heroic'.<em>This is John Houston, TPN News, signing off."

