// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4215776534" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white> {HeroName}. Open your mind to us.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>You have an incoming message from Investigator Whitworth<t=6 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=6><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white> {HeroName}, we just got a signal from the Lodestone Technologies security system. It's detected that the archives have already been breached.<t=6 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=6><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>We've also identified who their hacker is, he's Syndicate, goes by the name of Decker. Take him down!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2699866738" "<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>Incoming message from Investigator Whitworth.<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>We just detected a tight beam data burst transmission coming from the mainframe.<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>Stopping Decker won't halt the transmission. He's having the mainframe transmit the data directly to another location.<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white> {HeroName}, you're going to have to destroy the mainframe before the transfer completes!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3112892960" "<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>Incoming message from Investigator Whitworth.<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white> {HeroName}, we didn't stop them in time. But we have traced the signal back to its destination.<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>Get out of there. They're in the Kearney-Lansing building, I need you to intercept them."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3233823848" "This ticky-tock is gettin' lengthy..."
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2321247858" "<em t=3>You sweat the namby-pambs, scamper."
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P3975475416" "Blueberry!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2194430725" "Decker"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1112260364" "Just three more seconds..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P356661880" "We're done here, begin withdraw."

