"P2478267424" "The hacker is... a computer?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3308576687" "You stopped Blueshift and his Resistance compatriots from escaping with the stolen Lodestone Technologies data. However, Blueshift mentally transferred something to you that is very, very confusing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P986855598" "That was a close one, {HeroName}. It would appear that Sergeant Iminez is a much more dangerous liability than we initially suspected. He will have to be dealt with.<br><br>On the plus side you apprehended two of our Syndicate most wanted.  Ministry Interrogators will be overjoyed to hear that we have two new visitors for them.<br><br>However, it looks like Lodestone Technologies will have to wait for our Ministry technicians to get their data out of Blueshift's cranial storage casing. He'll undergo interrogation and then memory removal and storage before he's mind wiped and integrated back into the Ministry. It has been some time since he worked for us, it will be good to have him back."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Scott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1680764902" "{HeroName}, I could use some good news."
// Answer Text :
"P2380984226" "Sinclair's given orders to take down Sergeant Iminez."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2213457083" "He got greedy and got sloppy, but that doesn't change the fact that he's got a lot of valuable intelligence in his thinkbox.<br><br>What's Sinclair's plan, simple wetworks or something more insidious?"
// Answer Text :
"P2803487364" ""(Explain the plan to pit the Syndicate and Resistance against each other.)"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2454657344" "I'm currently in negotiations that will make such a conflict inconsequential. Take Iminez out, but don't finish him off. I'll make sure that we win the ensuing engagement and pick Iminez up during the aftermath."
// Answer Text :
"P2639291473" "And if he fights back?"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P2250180621" "Well don't be an idiot about it. Who's more important, you or him?"
// Answer Text :
"P4262229902" "Understood."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - IminezDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3159292134" "Hey, wait a second... Aren't you...?"
// Answer Text :
"P3683135146" "Psst. You miss me?"
// Answer Text :
"P1113004049" "Where's my coffee, Iminez?"
// Answer Text :
"P2217723215" "I said two creams in my coffee."
// Answer Text :
"P3544085661" "I told you I believed in you."
// Answer Text :
"P4052371120" "Were they out of decaf?"
// Answer Text :
"P2076500137" "How's your mood now, Iminez?"
// Answer Text :
"P1218931063" "I told you not to steep it for too long."
// Answer Text :
"P1436718109" "How was your scone?"
// Answer Text :
"P1731184018" "You ever tried Earl Grey cold?"
// Answer Text :
"P4232830225" "You've got red on you."
// Page AttackedPage Text :
"P3853299967" "Wha...?!"
// Answer Text :
"P1016864384" "(Attack)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3530743664" "Sergeant Iminez has been feeding the Resistance information, that much is clear. Additionally, it's clear that the Resistance is working with the Syndicate here in Imperial City. This cannot stand. Iminez needs to go down, and the Syndicate and Resistance cannot be allowed to align. Luckily, I have a plan.<br><br>We put a tail on Sergeant Iminez and followed him to this warehouse in Industry Avenue. From the look of it, he's got a meeting with his buddies in the Resistance and Syndicate, no doubt to explain why his intel resulted in all of their personnel getting arrested. <color orange>I want you to go to that meeting, only, you're going to fit right in there.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3582309032" "Attend meeting in Industry Avenue warehouse"
// SendOffString :
"P3288043736" "You aren't going to show up and arrest Iminez. No, I'm going to turn his worthless existence into the catalyst that sets the Syndicate and Resistance at one another's throats.<br><br><color orange>You're going to that meeting, only in the guise of a Syndicate thug. When you find Sergeant Iminez, kill him.</color><br><br>When the Resistance sees a Syndicate go-ganger take down their inside man in the PPD they're going to go ballistic. Likewise, if the Syndicate see one of their own start shooting, they're going to jump in. Once the bullets start flying, get out of there.<br><br><color Paragon>Members of the Resistance working undercover for Calvin Scott should inform him of what is happening.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P535776660" "Eliminate Sergeant Iminez in warehouse"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3746235441" "I'm not sure how long Iminez is going to be at that Resistance and Syndicate meeting, so you'd better hurry, we might not get another shot at this."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2012672029" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Taking Out The Trash</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3533012479" "You quickly don your disguise and enter the warehouse. You hope this works."
