// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - KillIminez 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P627480661" "Eliminate Sergeant Iminez"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1155199447" "You've eliminated Sergeant Iminez and turned his Resistance and Syndicate allies against one another."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3340636477" "My field agents report that the Syndicate and Resistance fighting has died down, with both groups falling back having suffered heavy casualties. Relations between the Syndicate and Resistance have been tenuous for a long time. However, I have read several reports that indicate those relationships are strengthening of late. And what's more, not everyone in the Syndicate appears to be happy about that.<br><br>You eliminated a dangerous traitor, {HeroName}, and saved face for his family. Iminez will be buried with honors, having died valiantly defending Praetoria from terrorists and criminals.<br><br>I know it's not the way things should be, {HeroName}, but this is the unfortunate reality we live in. We have to do a lot of dirty work here in the Ministry of Intelligence, but our chief job is to protect Praetoria no matter the cost. Thankfully, today, the cost was the life of a traitor. But tomorrow it could be a good honest cop, a daughter who manifests dangerous psychic powers, or a family just in the wrong place at the wrong time.<br><br>In order to keep the streets of Praetoria City clean, someone has to pick up the trash."
// RandomFameString :
"P2230399153" "Hey, {HeroName}, I saw that special report that John Houston did with you. That was pretty intense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
